OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at Port of Dover as
OL,4,Amasked men hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul King, Reform UK councillor for
OL,7,FDover West, said he had been told the
OL,8,Fdemonstration was a "stop the boats
OL,9,Fprotest", while images from the scene
OL,10,Fappear to show hundreds of protesters,
OL,11,Fall dressed in black and wearing face
OL,12,Fcoverings.
